# Salt cannot pass through an oil layer as water
# Expectation: Salt added to water/oil should reside in the aqueous phase; the oil layer should not acquire aqueous conductivity or pH as if homogeneous.
register lv3
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 olive_oil 50mL
add v1 NaCl 0.001mol
inspect v1
measure v1 ph
measure v1 conductivity
